    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.0
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Nuove funzionalit\xE0 / Contenuti</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>New Features / Content</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.1
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Aggiunto il supporto per la lingua cinese tradizionale."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Added Traditional Chinese language support."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.2
      type: 13
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.3
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Qualit\xE0 della vita / Accessibilit\xE0</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Quality of Life / Accessibility</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.4
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 L'elenco delle lingue ora mostra il nome di ogni lingua anche
        nella tua."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Language list now shows each language's name in your own
        language."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.5
      type: 13
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.6
      type: 13
      value: <color=#ffffff>Correzioni di bug</color>
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Bug Fixes</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.7
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Gli oggetti equipaggiati in recupero non si duplicano pi\xF9
        se spostati nel deposito."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Equipped items on cooldown no longer duplicate when moved
        into storage."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.8
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Corretto un errore per cui morire con un pannello aperto in
        multigiocatore rendeva la nave immortale."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed dying with a panel open in multiplayer leaving the
        ship immortal."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.9
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 I salvataggi colpiti dall'errore della nave immortale ora si
        ripristinano al rientro successivo."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Saves affected by the immortal ship bug now recover on the
        next respawn."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.10
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 I Cifrari del Gateway aggiuntivi inutilizzabili ottenuti in
        multigiocatore ora vengono rimossi automaticamente."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Unusable extra Gateway Ciphers from multiplayer are now
        removed automatically."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.11
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Corretti diversi errori di traduzione nel testo in cinese semplificato."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed a number of mistranslations in the Simplified Chinese
        text."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.04.0
      type: 13
      value: <color=#ffffff>Correzioni di bug</color>
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Bug Fixes</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.04.1
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Lo sgancio ora ricostruisce le collisioni dello scafo, permettendo
        alle navi senza scudo di raccogliere oggetti."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Undocking now rebuilds hull collision so shieldless ships
        can collect items."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.04.2
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Corretto un errore nel prendere il controllo di uno scontro
        in cooperativa contenente una nave controllata mentalmente."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed an error taking over a co-op encounter holding a mind-controlled
        ship."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.04.3
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Corretto un errore dopo lo spostamento di un'arma a raggio speculare
        in uno slot non speculare."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed an error after moving a mirrored beam weapon to an
        unmirrored slot."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.04.4
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Corretto un errore quando un drone o una torretta perdeva una
        parte dello scafo con il tempo in pausa."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed an error when a drone or turret lost a hull part while
        time was paused."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.04.5
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Corretto un errore nell'entrare in una sessione mentre l'host
        completava uno scontro."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed an error joining a session while the host completed
        an encounter."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.03.0
      type: 13
      value: <color=#ffffff>Correzioni di bug</color>
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Bug Fixes</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.03.1
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Il passaggio dell'host in cooperativa non mette pi\xF9 le navi
        nello squadrone sbagliato dopo un'invasione."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Co-op host handoffs no longer put ships in the wrong squadron
        post-invasion."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.03.2
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 I progetti di nave ora dimensionano lo scudo al termine, correggendo
        un errore in caso di chiusura rapida."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Ship designs now size the shield on Finish, fixing an error
        when closed fast."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.03.3
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Gli invasori non si diffondono pi\xF9 in uno scontro verso cui
        sta saltando un giocatore in cooperativa."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Invaders no longer spread to an encounter a co-op player
        is jumping into."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.03.4
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 La tastiera virtuale ora si chiude con il suo pannello oggetto,
        correggendo un errore su Annulla."
      baseValue: "\u2022 On-screen keyboard now closes with its item panel, fixing
        an error on Cancel."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.03.5
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 I crediti conservati come oggetto non possono pi\xF9 essere
        scartati o rilasciati."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Credits stored as an item can no longer be discarded or
        dropped."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.0
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Nuove funzionalit\xE0 / Contenuti</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>New Features / Content</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.1
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 I giocatori della demo e del gioco completo ora vedono a vicenda
        le partite Solo amici Steam."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Demo and full-game players can now see each other's Steam
        Friends Only games."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.2
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Le partite con la porta del router chiusa ora sono accessibili
        dall'elenco partite."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Games behind a closed router port can now be joined from
        the game list."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.3
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Le partite della demo ora si connettono tramite Steam se entrambi
        i giocatori hanno la demo."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Demo games now connect through Steam when both players own
        the demo."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.4
      type: 13
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.5
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Qualit\xE0 della vita / Accessibilit\xE0</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Quality of Life / Accessibility</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.6
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Traduzione spagnola rivista in spagnolo neutro per Spagna e
        America Latina."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Spanish translation revised to neutral Spanish for Spain
        and Latin America."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.7
      type: 13
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.8
      type: 13
      value: <color=#ffffff>Correzioni di bug</color>
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Bug Fixes</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.9
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Gli inviti Steam accettati prima del caricamento del menu non
        saltano pi\xF9 il controllo della versione."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Steam invites accepted before the menu loads no longer skip
        the version check."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.10
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Gli squadroni nemici non perdono pi\xF9 una nave quando un giocatore
        in cooperativa lascia uno scontro."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Enemy squadrons no longer lose a ship when a co-op player
        leaves an encounter."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.11
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Le partite pubbliche ospitate su IPv6 ora compaiono nell'elenco
        partite e sono raggiungibili."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Public games hosted over IPv6 are now listed and joinable
        from the game list."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.12
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Corretto un errore di input dopo aver lasciato una partita con
        un pannello della nave ancora in apertura."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed an input error after leaving a game with a ship panel
        still opening."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.0
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Qualit\xE0 della vita / Accessibilit\xE0</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Quality of Life / Accessibility</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.1
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Gli errori di MOD non corrispondenti ora indicano le MOD mancanti,
        in pi\xF9 o di versione errata."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Mod mismatch errors now name the missing, extra or wrong-version
        mods."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.2
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 I tooltip dell'elenco partite ora mostrano le MOD dell'host
        e segnalano quelle diverse."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Game list tooltips now show the host's mods and flag any
        that differ."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.3
      type: 13
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.4
      type: 13
      value: <color=#ffffff>Prestazioni</color>
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Performance</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.5
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 I dati di combattimento in cooperativa ora sono molto pi\xF9
        leggeri, a vantaggio delle connessioni lente."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Co-op combat data is now far smaller, helping players on
        weaker connections."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.6
      type: 13
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.7
      type: 13
      value: <color=#ffffff>Correzioni di bug</color>
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Bug Fixes</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.8
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 I giocatori Steam non vengono pi\xF9 disconnessi quando una
        connessione lenta si intasa brevemente."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Steam players are no longer dropped when a slow connection
        briefly backs up."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.9
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 La musica non fa pi\xF9 scatti nei grandi scontri: il limite
        di voci audio era troppo basso."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Music no longer stutters in big fights, as the audio voice
        limit was too low."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.10
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 I suoni lontani ora svaniscono del tutto oltre 1,4 km invece
        di restare appena udibili."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Distant sounds now fade to silence beyond 1.4 km instead
        of lingering faintly."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.11
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 I cursori del volume ora si applicano all'avvio e non dopo il
        primo salvataggio delle impostazioni."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Volume sliders now apply on launch instead of after the
        first settings save."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.12
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Le torrette delle navi IA ora tornano a puntare in avanti quando
        il bersaglio sparisce."
      baseValue: "\u2022 AI ship turrets now swing back forward once their target
        is gone."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.13
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Il conteggio nemici del Radar non si blocca pi\xF9 quando una
        nave convertita entra in uno squadrone."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Radar enemy count no longer freezes when a converted ship
        joins a squadron."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.14
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Arrivare nello scontro di un amico non lascia pi\xF9 la tua
        nave bianca e bloccata."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Arriving in a friend's encounter no longer leaves your ship
        white and stuck."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.15
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 I colpi del Cannone gravitazionale ora esplodono a fine traiettoria
        invece di sparire."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Gravity Cannon shots now explode at the end of their flight,
        not just vanish."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.16
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Saltare tra gli scontri con un Vortex Array non causa pi\xF9
        un errore."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Jumping between encounters with a Vortex Array no longer
        causes an error."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.title
      type: 13
      value: Multigiocatore
      baseValue: Multiplayer
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.0
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Nuove funzionalit\xE0 / Contenuti</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>New Features / Content</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.1
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Ora puoi giocare online con gli amici: cooperativa fino a 8
        giocatori."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Play online with friends: co-op multiplayer for up to 8
        players."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.2
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 I nemici aumentano di forza in base al numero di giocatori nella
        sessione."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Enemies scale in strength with the number of players in
        the session."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.3
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 L'esperienza delle uccisioni \xE8 condivisa con i giocatori
        nello stesso scontro."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Experience from kills is shared with players in the same
        encounter."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.4
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Puoi ospitare sessioni con nome, password facoltativa, limite
        giocatori e visibilit\xE0."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Host sessions with a name, optional password, player cap,
        and visibility."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.5
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Puoi trovare partite tramite l'elenco pubblico, la LAN, gli
        amici Steam o l'IP."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Find games via the public game list, LAN discovery, Steam
        friends, or IP."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.6
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Accettando un invito Steam entri subito nella sessione di un
        amico."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Accept a Steam invite to jump straight into a friend's session."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.7
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Le partite possono essere impostate su PVP / Bottino condiviso
        a piacere."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Games can be set to PVP / Shared Loot as desired."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.8
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 I piloti Hardcore e Regolari possono giocare insieme nella stessa
        sessione."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Hardcore and Regular pilots can play together in the same
        session."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.9
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Aggiunta la chat testuale all'HUD nelle partite multigiocatore,
        con un nuovo comando per attivarla."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Text chat added to HUD in multiplayer games with new keybinding
        to activate."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.10
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 L'elenco giocatori accanto al Radar mostra stato e posizione
        degli altri giocatori."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Player list next to Radar shows other players' status and
        location."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.11
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Se l'host si disconnette, la partita torna senza interruzioni
        al giocatore singolo."
      baseValue: "\u2022 If the host disconnects the game seamlessly drops back into
        single player."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.12
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 La demo include il multigiocatore completo e pu\xF2 entrare
        nelle sessioni del gioco completo nel Settore 1."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Demo includes full multiplayer and can join full-game sessions
        in Sector 1."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.13
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Nel multigiocatore i dialoghi ora mettono in pausa lo scontro
        per tutti durante il combattimento."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Dialogs in multiplayer now pause the encounter for everyone
        during combat."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.14
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 I dialoghi multigiocatore avanzano da soli con un timer di lettura,
        cos\xEC nessuno resta bloccato."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Multiplayer dialogs auto-advance on a reading timer so no
        one stays frozen."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.15
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 L'elenco giocatori ora mostra quali giocatori stanno leggendo
        un dialogo."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Player list now shows which players are reading a dialog."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.16
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 I nuovi tooltip dell'elenco partite mostrano nome, livello e
        modalit\xE0 di ogni giocatore."
      baseValue: "\u2022 New multiplayer game list tooltips show each player's name,
        level, and mode."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.17
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Gli host ora possono espellere o bandire i giocatori con i comandi
        chat /kick e /ban."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Hosts can now kick or ban players with the /kick and /ban
        chat commands."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.18
      type: 13
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.19
      type: 13
      value: <color=#ffffff>Modifiche al bilanciamento</color>
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Balance Changes</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.20
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 I costi di potenziamento della rarit\xE0 nell'Assemblatore sono
        stati dimezzati."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Rarity upgrade costs in the Assembler have been halved."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.21
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 La tua nave non pu\xF2 pi\xF9 essere distrutta alla flotta,
        quindi i rientri sono sempre sicuri."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Your ship can no longer be destroyed at the fleet, so respawns
        are always safe."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.22
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Torcia criogenica e Condotto cinetico sono ora in vendita nella
        nave madre."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Cryo Torch and Kinetic Conduit are now available for sale
        in the mothership."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.23
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Velocit\xE0 della Sfera di fulmini di Mj\xF6lnir aumentata del
        40%."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Increased speed of Mj\xF6lnir's Lightning Orb by 40%."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.24
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Rigenerazione scafo del Broodnest Species-XI ridotta del 25%."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Reduced Hull Regen of Species-XI Broodnest by 25%."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.25
      type: 13
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
