      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: SettingsDataControl.hudScale.tooltip
      type: 8
      value: Scala dell'HUD (heads-up display) di gioco.
      baseValue: Scale of the heads-up display in game.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: SettingsDataControl.minibarScale.description
      type: 7
      value: Scala della minimappa
      baseValue: Minibar Scale
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: SettingsDataControl.minibarScale.tooltip
      type: 8
      value: Scala delle barre secondarie (scudo/scafo/ecc.) visualizzate sotto le
        navi.
      baseValue: Scale of the minibars (shield / hull / etc) displayed below ships.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: SettingsDataControl.floatingDamageScale.description
      type: 7
      value: Scala dei numeri di danno
      baseValue: Damage Number Scale
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: SettingsDataControl.floatingDamageScale.tooltip
      type: 8
      value: Imposta la scala dei numeri di danno fluttuanti sopra le navi nemiche.
        Impostandolo allo 0% verranno disattivati completamente.
      baseValue: Set the scale of floating damage numbers above enemy ships. Setting
        to 0% will disable them entirely.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: SettingsDataControl.cameraShake.description
      type: 7
      value: Tremore telecamera
      baseValue: Camera Shake
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: SettingsDataControl.cameraShake.tooltip
      type: 8
      value: Fa tremare la telecamera quando subisci danni o spari con armi pesanti.
      baseValue: Shake the camera when taking damage or firing heavy weapons.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: SettingsDataControl.showWarningGlow.description
      type: 7
      value: Mostra bagliore di avviso
      baseValue: Show Warning Glow
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: SettingsDataControl.showWarningGlow.tooltip
      type: 8
      value: Mostra un bagliore attorno al bordo dello schermo quando il tuo scudo
        si abbassa o hai poca salute.
      baseValue: Shows a glow around the edge of the screen when your shield goes
        down or you are on low health.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: SettingsDataControl.smallShipBar.description
      type: 7
      value: Barra nave compatta
      baseValue: Small Ship Bar
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: SettingsDataControl.smallShipBar.tooltip
      type: 8
      value: "Riduce la barra della nave in fondo all'HUD per una maggiore visibilit\xE0
        verticale."
      baseValue: Shrink down the ship bar at the bottom of the HUD for more vertical
        visibility.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: SettingsDataControl.playerBars.description
      type: 7
      value: Mostra barre del giocatore
      baseValue: Show Player Minibars
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: SettingsDataControl.playerBars.tooltip
      type: 8
      value: "Mostra barre secondarie sotto la nave del giocatore per poter monitorare
        pi\xF9 facilmente scudo e scafo."
      baseValue: Shows minibars below the player ship so you can more easily track
        your shield / hull.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: SettingsDataControl.radialOpacity.description
      type: 7
      value: "Opacit\xE0 di visualizzazione radiale"
      baseValue: Radial Display Opacity
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: SettingsDataControl.radialOpacity.tooltip
      type: 8
      value: "Scudo, scafo e calore vengono visualizzati in un cerchio attorno alla
        tua nave. Regolandone l'opacit\xE0 saranno pi\xF9 o meno visibili; impostandola
        a 0% saranno disattivati completamente."
      baseValue: Shield, hull and heat are displayed around your ship in a circle.
        Adjusting their opacity will make them more or less visible, setting to 0%
        will disable it entirely.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: SettingsDataControl.ignoreConsumables.description
      type: 7
      value: Ignora i consumabili
      baseValue: Ignore Consumables
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: SettingsDataControl.ignoreConsumables.tooltip
      type: 8
      value: 'Imposta quando traini e raccogli i consumabili.

        Mai = Raccogli
        tutti i consumabili

        Intelligente = Riempi le pile esistenti e mantieni
        almeno una pila dei consumabili assegnati

        Sempre = Non raccogliere
        alcun consumabile'
      baseValue: 'Set when you will tractor and pick up consumables.

        Never
        = Collect all consumables

        Smart = Fill existing stacks and keep
        at least one stack of assigned consumables

        Always = Do not collect
        any consumables'
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: SettingsDataControl.ignoreConsumables.value.0
      type: 7
      value: Mai
      baseValue: Never
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: SettingsDataControl.ignoreConsumables.value.1
      type: 7
      value: Intelligente
      baseValue: Smart
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: SettingsDataControl.ignoreConsumables.value.2
      type: 7
      value: Sempre
      baseValue: Always
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: SettingsDataControl.ignoreItemsBelow.description
      type: 7
      value: Ignora oggetti inferiori
      baseValue: Ignore Items Below
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: SettingsDataControl.ignoreItemsBelow.tooltip
