      value: "Imposta la rarit\xE0 minima dell'equipaggiamento che potrai trainare
        e raccogliere."
      baseValue: Set the minimum rarity of equipment you will be able to tractor
        and pick up.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
