  - categoryName: Resource.FixedStar
    entries:
    - key: rYaZS5Ys.name
      type: 5
      value: Alfa Saxa
      baseValue: Alpha Saxa
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Z54HZzWp.name
      type: 5
      value: Astralis
      baseValue: Astralis
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: Z54HZzWp.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Era ora che vedessi una faccia amica! Dov'\xE8 il vecchio Gid?"
      baseValue: About time I saw a friendly face! Where's ol' Gid?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Z54HZzWp.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: Novus Prime... Ti mando le coordinate.
      baseValue: Novus Prime... I'll send you the coordinates.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Z54HZzWp.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "L'iperguida fa i capricci... quella dannata cosa ha vita propria. Mi
        servir\xE0 un po' di tempo. Tieni lontani quegli ostili, ti va?"
      baseValue: Hyperdrive's actin' up... bloody thing's got a mind of its own.
        I'll need a wee bit o' time. Keep those hostiles off me, will ya?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.name
      type: 5
      value: Avalon
      baseValue: Avalon
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: PiwXpqcc.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: La tua incursione finisce qui. Sei irrimediabilmente surclassato!
      baseValue: Your incursion ends here. You are hopelessly outmatched!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Non ne sarei cos\xEC sicuro."
      baseValue: I wouldn't be so sure about that.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: Tutte le navi, concentrate il fuoco sulla Cittadella. Tutto finisce
        qui!
      baseValue: All ships, focus fire on the Citadel. This ends here!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.fleeDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: Lo scafo sta per cedere. Metto in salvo l'equipaggio... ora tocca a
        te.
      baseValue: Hull's about to give. I'm getting the crew clear... it's on you
        now.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.completeDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: Ottimo lavoro. Ora vai a piazzare quella chiave di volta nel gateway
        di settore. Non abbiamo ancora finito!
      baseValue: Good work. Now, go place that keystone in the sector gateway. We're
        not done yet!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: shBT47eM.name
      type: 5
      value: Inferno
      baseValue: Infernum
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: shBT47eM.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "\xC8 un bel serpentone..."
      baseValue: That's a big snake...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: shBT47eM.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Ti risparmio la battuta pi\xF9 ovvia..."
      baseValue: I'll spare you the obvious joke...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lcAfYiDp.name
      type: 5
      value: Nightfall
      baseValue: Nightfall
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: lcAfYiDp.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: Maledetti cultisti. Scommetto che credono negli alieni.
      baseValue: Damn cultists. I bet they believe in aliens.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lcAfYiDp.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: Ti sono mancati tutti gli alieni contro cui abbiamo combattuto?
      baseValue: Did you miss all the aliens we've been fighting?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lcAfYiDp.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: I ricordi del futuro sono dimenticati!
      baseValue: Forgotten are the memories of the future!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lcAfYiDp.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "Vabb\xE8. Non bere il loro Kool-Aid."
      baseValue: Whatever. Just don't drink any of their Kool-Aid.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: gkWSs2X1.name
      type: 5
      value: Novus Prime
      baseValue: Novus Prime
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: z8m42dFQ.name
      type: 5
      value: Periculum
      baseValue: Periculum
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: 0lTPPaVb.name
      type: 5
      value: "Serenit\xE0"
      baseValue: Serenity
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 0lTPPaVb.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: Non puoi togliermi il cielo!
      baseValue: You can't take the sky from me!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 0lTPPaVb.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: Di cosa stai parlando?
      baseValue: What are you talking about?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 0lTPPaVb.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: Solo qualcosa da una delle serie TV che ho conservato.
      baseValue: Just something from one of the TV series I kept.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 0lTPPaVb.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "Ti mostrer\xF2 un mondo senza peccato."
      baseValue: I'm going to show you a world without sin.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 0lTPPaVb.arrivalDialog.4
      type: 2
      value: Visto? Ha colto il riferimento...
      baseValue: See? He got the reference...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: frtmSpS2.name
      type: 5
      value: Virenum
      baseValue: Virenum
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: frtmSpS2.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: Sto rilevando livelli di radiazioni pericolosamente elevati.
      baseValue: I'm detecting dangerously high levels of radiation.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: frtmSpS2.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Non \xE8 cos\xEC per lo spazio in generale?"
      baseValue: Isn't that just space in general?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: frtmSpS2.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Pi\xF9 del normale. Quella nave le perde ovunque."
      baseValue: This is higher than normal. That ship is leaking it everywhere.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: frtmSpS2.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: Ottimo. Proprio quello di cui avevamo bisogno...
      baseValue: Great. Just what we needed...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: R2NUkvrp.name
      type: 5
      value: Waypoint Alfa
      baseValue: Waypoint Alpha
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: wErwJOkj.name
      type: 5
      value: Waypoint Beta
      baseValue: Waypoint Beta
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: UcQcZrfr.name
      type: 5
      value: Waypoint Gamma
      baseValue: Waypoint Gamma
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: TEyzaBb4.name
      type: 5
      value: Asgard
      baseValue: Asgard
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: T748amiF.name
      type: 5
      value: Bastione
      baseValue: Bastion
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: T748amiF.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Una nave del Conclave... inaspettato. Vieni a vedere che aspetto ha
        veramente la libert\xE0?"
      baseValue: A Conclave ship... unexpected. Do you come to see what freedom truly
        looks like?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: T748amiF.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: Vado dove devo.
      baseValue: I go where I need to.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: T748amiF.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Allora guarda bene. Questo \xE8 ci\xF2 che il Conclave teme, ci\xF2
        che non potr\xE0 mai controllare."
      baseValue: Then take a good look. This is what the Conclave fears, what it
        could never control.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: T748amiF.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: Mi piacciono abbastanza questi tizi...
      baseValue: I kind of like these guys...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 15rTZw3b.name
      type: 5
      value: "Bifr\xF6st"
      baseValue: "Bifr\xF6st"
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: 15rTZw3b.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: Oh, guarda! Guai doppi. Una coppia che fa squadra... proprio come noi!
      baseValue: Oh, look! Double trouble. A pair teaming up... just like us!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 15rTZw3b.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: Mi chiedo quale sia il cervello...
      baseValue: I wonder which one is the brains...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: W48tqWIi.name
      type: 5
      value: Genesi
      baseValue: Genesis
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.name
      type: 5
      value: Nilfheim
      baseValue: Nilfheim
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: oPuSchCr.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Ti lanci verso il Prisma come tutti i conquistatori prima di te...
        cieco a ci\xF2 che non capisci."
      baseValue: You charge toward the Prism like all conquerors before you... blind
        to what you do not understand.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: Ci scusiamo per il ritardo...
      baseValue: Apologies for the delay...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: Ancora una volta sulla breccia, tutte le navi all'attacco!
      baseValue: Once more unto the breach, all ships engage!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.fleeDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: Non reggeremo ancora a lungo. Mi ritiro. Fate in modo che non sia stato
        inutile.
      baseValue: We won't hold together much longer. I'm pulling back. Don't let
        this be for nothing.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.completeDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: Un altro nemico sconfitto. Ben fatto. Carichiamo quel gateway di settore.
      baseValue: Another enemy vanquished. Well done. Let's get that sector gateway
        charged.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.completeDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: Solo un altro settore ci separa dalla Terra.
      baseValue: Only one more sector stands between us and Earth.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.completeDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: Un settore pieno di piante...
      baseValue: A sector full of plants...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.completeDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: Piante? Ah, giusto, la Flora... deliziosa...
      baseValue: Plants? Oh right, the Flora... lovely...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: LNahHPg9.name
      type: 5
      value: Tartarus
      baseValue: Tartarus
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: LNahHPg9.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: I segreti del Fantasma ora sono nostri. Andatevene... o sarete sepolti
        con loro.
      baseValue: The Phantom's secrets are ours now. Leave... or be buried with them.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: s6SdfeHC.name
      type: 5
      value: Vanaheimr
      baseValue: Vanaheimr
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: s6SdfeHC.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "In questa zona c'\xE8 una tensione insolitamente alta..."
      baseValue: This area has an unusually high voltage about it...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: s6SdfeHC.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: E questo cosa significa esattamente?
      baseValue: And that means what, exactly?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: s6SdfeHC.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: Se gli scudi restano abbassati abbastanza a lungo, potremo ricaricare
        quel vecchio lettore MP3.
      baseValue: If the shields drop long enough, we can recharge that old MP3 player.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: p4hMB2cf.name
      type: 5
      value: Waypoint Alfa
      baseValue: Waypoint Alpha
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: i7YRZJJr.name
      type: 5
      value: Waypoint Beta
      baseValue: Waypoint Beta
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: n6LzRSl6.name
      type: 5
      value: Waypoint Gamma
      baseValue: Waypoint Gamma
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: IDll0rCJ.name
      type: 5
      value: Xenosis
      baseValue: Xenosis
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: Dlbb7rr7.name
      type: 5
      value: Cindros
      baseValue: Cindros
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: Dlbb7rr7.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: Qui finisce il tuo cammino. La galassia appartiene a chi ha la forza
        di riscriverla.
      baseValue: This is where your path ends. The galaxy belongs to those with the
        strength to rewrite it.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lALYBu7d.name
      type: 5
      value: Crypsis
      baseValue: Crypsis
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: lALYBu7d.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "La tua sfida \xE8 illogica. Arrenditi ora per una conservazione ottimale."
      baseValue: Your defiance is illogical. Surrender now for optimal preservation.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
