    - key: vVHMYbzU.echoPartDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: Efficiente. Brutale. Sapevo che non mi avresti deluso.
      baseValue: Efficient. Brutal. I knew you wouldn't disappoint.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: vVHMYbzU.echoPartDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Questo componente non \xE8 mai stato loro, fin dall'inizio. Apparteneva
        a chi era venuto prima."
      baseValue: This component was never theirs to begin with. It belonged to the
        ones who came before.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: vVHMYbzU.echoPartDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: vVHMYbzU.echoPartDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "Non indugiare. C'\xE8 ancora molto da distruggere... e molto da costruire."
      baseValue: Don't linger. There's more to break... and more to build.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
