      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: x4GIvJUI.echoPartDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Perfino la Flora, cos\xEC disperata nel voler preservare la natura,
        si aggrappava a reliquie che a malapena comprendeva."
      baseValue: Even the Flora, so desperate to preserve nature, clung to relics
        they barely comprehended.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: x4GIvJUI.echoPartDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: x4GIvJUI.echoPartDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Un altro pezzo rivendicato... il disegno diventa pi\xF9 chiaro con
        ogni pezzo."
      baseValue: Another piece claimed... the design grows clearer with each one.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.name
      type: 5
      value: "Mj\xF6lnir"
      baseValue: "Mj\xF6lnir"
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: 7iLARRe1.echoPartDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: Di nuovo tu... Per quale motivo stai collezionando queste parti?
      baseValue: You again... What are you collecting these parts for?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.echoPartDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.echoPartDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Questa non \xE8 tecnologia Phantom. \xC8 stata creata dagli Architetti...
        coloro che hanno disseminato la vita tra le stelle."
      baseValue: This isn't Phantom technology. It was crafted by the Architects...
        the ones who seeded life across the stars.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.echoPartDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: Prima che perdessero il loro scopo... e svanissero nella loro luce.
      baseValue: Before they lost their purpose... and vanished into their own light.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.echoPartDialog.4
      type: 2
      value: "Lo rivendico per uno scopo superiore. Quando verr\xE0 il momento, lo
        vedrai."
      baseValue: I'm claiming it for a higher purpose. When the time comes you will
        see.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
